    },
    "The picture was not removed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "头像未移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The picture was not saved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "头像未保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use at least one letter or number." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请至少使用一个字母或数字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What this bot is for" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个机器人的用途"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep listening when locked" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "锁屏时继续聆听"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A voice conversation that is already listening keeps going when you lock the phone or switch apps, so you can talk hands-free. While locked, Conduit always listens again after each response and keeps listening through silence. End it by saying a goodbye phrase or from the app. Uses more battery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已在聆听的语音对话会在你锁屏或切换应用后继续进行，让你可以免手操作对话。锁屏期间，Conduit 会在每次回复后自动继续聆听，并在静默时保持聆听。说出结束语或在应用中即可结束对话。会消耗更多电量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screen stays on while a voice conversation is open, including the live voice modes. When off, the phone locks on its usual timer: live voice calls keep going in the background, and a classic voice conversation does too with Keep Listening When Locked on. Applies to this device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语音对话（包括实时语音模式）打开时屏幕保持常亮。关闭后，手机会按平常的时间自动锁定：实时语音通话会在后台继续，开启“锁屏时继续聆听”后，经典语音对话也会继续。仅适用于此设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unsaved voice calls" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未保存的语音通话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice calls waiting to save: %lld" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待保存的语音通话：%lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Hermes server can't save voice calls yet. Install or update the Hermes notifier plugin on your Hermes server, then tap Save Now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 Hermes 服务器暂时无法保存语音通话。请在 Hermes 服务器上安装或更新 Hermes notifier 插件，然后轻点“立即保存”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These calls are kept on this device and Conduit retries them automatically. It keeps up to 20 calls, and a call that still hasn't saved after 7 days is dropped." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些通话保存在此设备上，Conduit 会自动重试。最多保留 20 个通话，7 天后仍未保存的通话将被丢弃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save Now" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "立即保存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Microphone and Speech Recognition for Conduit in Settings to use a wake phrase." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请在“设置”中允许 Conduit 使用麦克风和语音识别，以便使用唤醒词。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hey %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "嘿，%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listen for a wake phrase" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "监听唤醒词"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Phrases with a single word are ignored." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只有一个词的唤醒词会被忽略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Say the phrase while Conduit is open to start voice on this profile, in whichever voice mode it uses. Listening runs on this iPhone, stops during calls and in the background, and the microphone indicator stays on while it listens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Conduit 打开时说出唤醒词，即可按此配置文件当前使用的语音模式开始语音对话。监听在此 iPhone 上进行，通话期间和后台时会停止，监听时麦克风指示灯会保持亮起。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone is not available right now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "麦克风当前不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use at least two words, such as \"%@\". Add a second spelling if Conduit mishears a name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请至少使用两个词，例如“%@”。如果 Conduit 听错了名字，可以再添加一种拼写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wake phrases" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "唤醒词列表"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wake phrases need microphone and speech recognition access." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "唤醒词需要麦克风和语音识别权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I don't know a profile or bot called %@, so I didn't start the job." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我不知道名为 %@ 的配置或机器人，所以没有启动任务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Started a background job on %@: %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已在 %1$@ 上启动后台任务：%2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send gives Hermes this value. Skip lets it continue without one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“发送”会把这个值交给 Hermes；“跳过”则让它在没有该值的情况下继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This request was answered elsewhere." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此请求已在其他地方处理。"
          }
