    },
    "The screen stays on while a voice conversation is open, including Gemini Live. When off, the phone locks on its usual timer and the conversation keeps going in the background. Applies to this device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语音对话（包括 Gemini Live）打开时屏幕保持常亮。关闭时，手机按平常的时间自动锁定，对话会在后台继续。仅适用于此设备。"
          }
