          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please check the authentication configuration for my Hermes dashboard. If dashboard login credentials have not been configured yet, set them up securely and tell me what username and password I should use with Hermes Conduit. Do not disable authentication." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请检查我的 Hermes 仪表盘的身份验证配置。如果尚未配置登录凭据，请安全地完成设置，并告诉我应与 Hermes Conduit 搭配使用的用户名和密码。不要禁用身份验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please check whether the Hermes dashboard is currently running. If it is, tell me which port it uses. If it is not running, set it up or start it. Make sure dashboard authentication remains enabled." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请检查 Hermes 仪表盘当前是否在运行。如果在运行，告诉我它使用的端口；如果没在运行，请设置或启动它。确保仪表盘身份验证保持启用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please check whether the Hermes dashboard is running. Make sure Tailscale is available on this machine, then configure Tailscale Serve so I can securely access the dashboard from my iPhone or iPad. Keep dashboard authentication enabled. When it is ready, tell me the hostname/address and port I should use with Hermes Conduit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请检查 Hermes 仪表盘是否在运行。确保这台机器上可用 Tailscale，然后配置 Tailscale Serve，使我能从 iPhone 或 iPad 安全访问仪表盘。保持仪表盘身份验证启用。就绪后告诉我应与 Hermes Conduit 搭配使用的主机名/地址和端口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please confirm the HTTPS URL I should use to access the Hermes dashboard through my existing reverse proxy, including any custom port or path prefix. Also confirm that dashboard authentication remains enabled." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请确认我通过现有反向代理访问 Hermes 仪表盘应使用的 HTTPS URL（包括自定义端口或路径前缀），并确认仪表盘身份验证保持启用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please make sure the Hermes dashboard is reachable from other devices on my local network, then tell me the machine's local IP address and the dashboard port I should use with Hermes Conduit. Keep dashboard authentication enabled." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请确保 Hermes 仪表盘可从本地网络中的其他设备访问，然后告诉我这台机器的局域网 IP 地址以及应与 Hermes Conduit 搭配使用的仪表盘端口。保持仪表盘身份验证启用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please set up or start the Hermes dashboard for me. Make sure it requires authentication, and tell me which port it is using when it is ready. Do not disable authentication." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请为我设置或启动 Hermes 仪表盘。确保它启用了身份验证，就绪后告诉我它使用的端口。不要禁用身份验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
