    "Text only" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅文字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That conversation belongs to another workspace. Switch profiles to open it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该对话属于另一个工作区。请切换档案后再打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That doesn’t look like a dashboard URL Conduit can use. Check it for typos — it should look like https://hermes.example." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这看起来不像 Conduit 能使用的仪表盘 URL。请检查是否有笔误——正确格式形如 https://hermes.example。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Hermes dashboard is running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hermes 仪表盘正在运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The board selection is local to this device; creating this task will not switch Hermes' global board." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看板选择仅对本设备生效；创建此任务不会切换 Hermes 的全局看板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The board's project directory (%@) applies to this task." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The board's project directory (%@) applies to this task."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看板的项目目录（%@）将应用于此任务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bundled bilingual wake model is not active yet. Its redistribution terms and checksums must be reviewed before it can be included in Conduit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "内置的双语唤醒模型尚未启用。其再分发条款与校验和须经审核，方可纳入 Conduit。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection to Hermes was lost. (UI test stub)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与 Hermes 的连接已断开。（UI 测试桩）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The dashboard certificate is expired or not yet valid. Check the certificate dates and this device’s date and time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仪表盘证书已过期或尚未生效。请检查证书日期以及本设备的日期和时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The dashboard did not respond in time. Check the address, the network connection, and whether the Hermes dashboard is running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仪表盘未及时响应。请检查地址、网络连接，以及 Hermes 仪表盘是否正在运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The dashboard is reachable but reported a server error. It may be restarting or unhealthy — try again in a moment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仪表盘可以访问，但报告了服务器错误。它可能正在重启或状态异常——请稍后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The dashboard responded in a way Conduit didn’t expect. Make sure the address points at a Hermes dashboard." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仪表盘的响应出乎 Conduit 的预料。请确认该地址指向的是 Hermes 仪表盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The decomposer reads these descriptions to route child tasks to the best specialist profile. Saving an empty description clears it (Hermes then falls back to name matching)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "分解器会读取这些描述，将子任务路由到最合适的专长档案。保存空描述即会清空（Hermes 随后回退为按名称匹配）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The gateway changed PCM sample rates during a stream." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网关在流式传输期间更改了 PCM 采样率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The gateway reported an unsupported PCM format." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网关报告了不受支持的 PCM 格式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The gateway returned an invalid file payload." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网关返回了无效的文件载荷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new task stays blocked until its parent completes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新任务在其父任务完成前保持阻塞。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The notifier receives a revocable credential for this phone. Your gateway never needs the phone’s push token, and you can turn notifications off here at any time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通知器会收到一个仅限这台手机使用的可撤销凭据。你的网关从不需要手机的推送令牌，你也可以随时在此关闭通知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reviewed wake model is not installed on this device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此设备未安装经过审核的唤醒模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The secret is stored only in Keychain. Reconnect after changing it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "密钥仅存储在 Keychain 中。更改后请重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected assistant speech provider is unavailable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选的助手语音提供方不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected microphone is unavailable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选麦克风不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected speech-to-text option is unavailable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选的语音转文字选项不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected speech-to-text provider returned an empty transcript." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选的语音转文字提供方返回了空转录结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected text-to-speech provider is not ready for this profile." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此档案所选的语音提供方尚未就绪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The slug is generated from the name (like Desktop) and cannot be changed after creation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "标识由名称生成（例如 Desktop），创建后无法更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The slug is immutable after creation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "标识在创建后不可更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The slug must be 1-64 lowercase letters or numbers, with hyphens or underscores after the first character." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "标识必须为 1-64 个小写字母或数字，首字符之后可使用连字符或下划线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech playback test was cancelled." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语音播放测试已取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech-to-text test was cancelled." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语音转文字测试已取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The task was created%@, but Hermes could not move it to %@. It was not duplicated; close this form and refresh the board. %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任务已创建%@，但 Hermes 无法将其移动到 %@。未创建重复任务；请关闭此表单并刷新看板。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The worker loops until a judge agrees the goal is met. Leave unlimited only with caution." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "工作代理会持续循环，直到评判者认可目标已达成。请谨慎使用不限轮数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The workspace path could not be encoded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法编码工作区路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme and interface preferences" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主题与界面偏好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no assistant response to branch from yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "还没有可供分支的助手回复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no message history to branch from." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有可供分支的消息历史。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These checks use the selected speech route and active profile. Provider credentials remain on Hermes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些测试使用所选语音通道和当前档案。提供方凭据仍保留在 Hermes 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These choices follow the active workspace." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些选项会跟随当前活跃的工作区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These questions are no longer active — Hermes timed them out and continued." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些问题已失效——Hermes 已超时并继续执行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These settings can’t be used yet. Go Back to edit them, then return here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些设置尚不可用。请点按「返回」修改，然后再回到这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These settings will fill the login form. You’ll tap Connect there when you’re ready." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些设置会填入登录表单。准备就绪后，请在那里轻点「连接」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They will be moved out of the active board view. Tasks are not being permanently deleted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它们将被移出活跃看板视图。任务不会被永久删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking" : {
      "localizations" : {
