    "Hermes did not start GPT-Live on the ChatGPT subscription, so Conduit did not connect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hermes 没有使用 ChatGPT 订阅启动 GPT-Live，因此 Conduit 没有连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermes returned an invalid GPT-Live answer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hermes 返回了无效的 GPT-Live 应答。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk with GPT-Live on the ChatGPT subscription your Hermes server is signed in to, instead of the Hermes speech pipeline. Hermes still does the work: GPT-Live hands requests to background jobs on this profile. The sign-in stays on your Hermes server, and it never falls back to API billing. Turning this on turns Gemini Live off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用你的 Hermes 服务器所登录的 ChatGPT 订阅与 GPT-Live 对话，而不是使用 Hermes 语音流程。工作仍由 Hermes 完成：GPT-Live 会把请求交给此配置文件上的后台任务。登录信息保留在你的 Hermes 服务器上，并且绝不会回退到 API 计费。开启此项会关闭 Gemini Live。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The GPT-Live connection was lost." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GPT-Live 连接已断开。"
